@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

state RegisterLogin <<choice>>
state TeacherStudentChoice <<choice>>

[*] --> RegisterLogin

RegisterLogin --> LoginSuccess : details provided
LoginSuccess --> TeacherStudentChoice : continue as teacher or student

TeacherStudentChoice --> TeacherChoice [valid] : continue as teacher
TeacherChoice --> CreateQuiz : create new quiz
TeacherChoice --> EditQuiz : edit existing quiz
TeacherChoice --> SaveDraftPost : save as draft or post quiz
TeacherChoice --> ViewResults : view quiz results
TeacherStudentChoice --> StudentChoice [invalid] : continue as student
StudentChoice --> SelectQuiz : select a quiz after notification
SelectQuiz --> AnswerQuiz : answer selected quiz
AnswerQuiz --> SubmitQuiz : submit quiz
SubmitQuiz --> ViewResult : view result after submission

LoginSuccess --> [*] : logout

@enduml
